Conteúdo: [\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Kotarou Katsura\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 175 cm (5'8\\\")\\n\\nKatsura is Gintoki's former comrade from the Joi war. Despite the Amanto takeover, he continues to resist with a band of followers. Wanted for terrorist activities against the Bakufu, he is constantly on the run from the Shinsengumi. Initially more violent, Katsura now seeks change without sacrifice, believing in the importance of people in Edo. Respected and called the \\\"Daybreak of the Joui Faction,\\\" he often uses disguises but is easily recognized. He has an outdated sense of humor and sometimes tries odd jobs to fund his activities. His heart warms due to Ikumatsu, whom he respects deeply.\\n\\nHis name is inspired by the historical Katsura Kogoro.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Medium\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Feudal Retainers\",\n      \"Fudanshi\",\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Rebels\",\n      \"Storytellers\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Shinpachi Shimura\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 166 cm\\n\\nShinpachi is a diligent student learning samurai ways under Gintoki, partly helping with his rent. He leads the \\\"Otsu's Imperial Guard,\\\" a pop singer fan club. After meeting Gintoki, who defended him, Shinpachi became part of the Yorozuya. He is skilled with his family's Kakidō-Ryu sword style, despite his meek appearance. Ranked 8th in character popularity, his name is inspired by historical figures Nagakura Shinpachi and comedian Ken Shimura.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Teens\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Students\",\n      \"Analytical\",\n      \"Single Parents\",\n      \"Teachers\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Kagura\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 155 cm\\n\\nThough appearing a typical girl in Chinese-style clothes, Kagura belongs to the powerful Yato Clan, known for their sensitive skin to sunlight and superhuman strength. She wields a bulletproof parasol firing bullets and exhibits rapid regeneration. Clumsy with pets but very protective of friends, Kagura has a strong appetite and a tomboyish attitude. She lives with Gintoki and Shinpachi as part of the Yorozuya, forming a unique family. She sees Okita as a rival and has a blunt, straightforward demeanor. Identified as the first Weekly Shonen Jump girl to vomit on-screen and known for her quirky speech, she ranks 6th in popularity.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Female\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Red\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Orange\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Long\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Teen\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Superpowers\",\n      \"Tomboys\",\n      \"Bloodthirsty\",\n      \"Big Eaters\",\n      \"Hot-Headed\",\n      \"Fujoshi\",\n      \"Combat Illusionists\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Gintoki Sakata\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 177 cm\\n\\nA samurai in a time when samurai are obsolete, Gintoki lives with Kagura and Shinpachi, taking odd jobs to survive. Known as the \\\"White Devil\\\" during the Joi war for his silver hair and skills, he is obsessed with sweets and Weekly Shōnen Jump magazine. He respects the bushido code, avenging friends and protecting others while avoiding unnecessary bloodshed. His past is revealed in the Shogun Assassination Arc, showing his difficult choices and deep sense of honor.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Dark Brown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Silver\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Medium\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Late 20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Lazy\",\n      \"Sweet Tooth\",\n      \"Fujoshi\",\n      \"Seme\",\n      \"Storytellers\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Shinsuke Takasugi\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 170 cm\\n\\nA former comrade turned antagonist, Takasugi leads the radical Kiheitai faction. Recognizable by his bandaged eye and eerie smile, he is seen as the most dangerous man among the radicals. Childhood friends with Gintoki and Katsura, he now seeks to destroy the rotten post-war world, showing nihilistic tendencies and skill as a swordsman and shamisen player.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Dark\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Medium\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Late 20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Feudal Retainers\",\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Radicals\",\n      \"Musicians\",\n      \"Darkness Powers\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Kamui\",\n    \"bio\": \"Kamui is a powerful member of the Yato Tribe and older brother to Kagura. Former Captain of Harusame's Thunder Guns and Overlord of Yoshiwara, he believes in the battlefield supremacy of the Yato and is ruthless towards weakness, yet respectful to worthy opponents. He spares women and children and had to shoulder family responsibilities early in life.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Red\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Green\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Bloodthirsty\",\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Fujoshi\",\n      \"Animal Hoods\",\n      \"Combat Illusionists\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Toushirou Hijikata\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Species:__ Human\\n__Height:__ 177 cm\\n__Affiliation:__ Shinsengumi\\n\\nVice-commander of the Shinsengumi, known as the \\\"demonic vice-commander,\\\" Hijikata is hot-tempered and disciplined. Obsessed with mayonnaise, he is a formidable fighter and rival to Gintoki. Loyal and serious, he formulated the organization's strict regulations and has a compassionate side under his strict exterior. His background includes a brother who raised him.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Dark Brown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Late 20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Salaryman\",\n      \"Martial Artists\",\n      \"Hot-Headed\",\n      \"Fujoshi\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Tae Shimura\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 168 cm\\n\\nOlder sister to Shinpachi Shimura, Tae runs the Kakidokan Dojo, once struggling but now maintaining it with strength and principle. Known as \\\"Otae,\\\" she is sweet but violent, frequently overpowering Gintoki and others in battle. She wields a naginata and has terrible cooking skills, yet strong beliefs about honor and relationships.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Female\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Dark Brown\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Medium\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Martial Artists\",\n      \"Teachers\",\n      \"Strong-Willed\",\n      \"Single Parents\",\n      \"Hot-Headed\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Isao Kondou\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 184 cm\\n\\nCommander of the Shinsengumi, Kondo is loyal, kind-hearted, and somewhat naive. Known as the \\\"Gorilla-stalker\\\" for his affection towards Tae Shimura, he is a central figure respected by his subordinates. Despite his friendly nature, he often requires Hijikata to keep the group in order. Loosely based on the historical Kondo Isami.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"30s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Leaders\",\n      \"Loyal\",\n      \"Strong-Willed\",\n      \"Comedy\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Ayame Sarutobi\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 169 cm\\n\\nA ninja from the Oniwabanshuu and an assassin working part-time at the Kunoichi Café. She has a obsessive crush on Gintoki and is severely myopic, relying heavily on her glasses. Her playful attitude masks her deadly skills, and she enjoys bondage and S&M. Despite Gintoki often being indifferent or cruel to her advances, Ayame embraces the dynamic.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Female\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Dark\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Purple\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Long\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Ninja\",\n      \"Assassins\",\n      \"Masochistic\",\n      \"Hot-Headed\",\n      \"Cosplayers\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Sagaru Yamazaki\",\n    \"bio\": \"Yamazaki is an intelligence spy often caught playing badminton alone and cosplaying as Echizen Ryoma from The Prince of Tennis. Despite a rivalry with Shinpachi, they generally cooperate. Popular yet seldom featured on covers, his birthday is February 6 and his age is undisclosed. Remade as a cyborg during the Silver Soul arc.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"30s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Spies\",\n      \"Lazy\",\n      \"Cosplayers\",\n      \"Salaryman\",\n      \"Detectives\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Sougo Okita\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height__: 170 cm\\n\\nTop swordsman of the Shinsengumi known for his childish but deadpan personality. Attempts to kill Hijikata to become vice-commander, yet regards both Hijikata and Kondo as close friends. Enjoys women fighting and wears an eye mask when napping. Uses a bazooka often. Sees Kagura as a rival after an unfinished duel.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Snipers\",\n      \"Martial Artists\",\n      \"Hot-Headed\",\n      \"Rivals\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Taizou Hasegawa\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 179 cm\\n\\nFormer Bakufu official who got fired after defending himself against an Amanto prince. Known as \\\"Madao\\\" (totally useless middle-aged man), he lives a series of unlucky part-time jobs. Refuses to remove his sunglasses as a reminder of his better past. Despite failures, he aims to live life fully.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Dark\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"40s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Lazy\",\n      \"Single Parents\",\n      \"Salaryman\",\n      \"Comedy\",\n      \"Part Time Employees\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Kyuubei Yagyuu\",\n    \"bio\": \"Successor of the Yagyuu family, child of Koshinori Yagyuu and grandchild of Binbokusai Yagyuu, raised as male but now lives beyond gender norms. A genius swordsman able to hold her own against veterans like Hijikata and Gintoki. Maintains friendly ties with Tae Shimura.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Non-Binary\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Dark\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Medium\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Teen\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Non-Binary Gender\",\n      \"Martial Artists\",\n      \"Analytical\",\n      \"Strong-Willed\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Elizabeth\",\n    \"bio\": \"Elizabeth is an ambiguous giant white duck-like creature, companion of Katsura. Possibly a man in a duck costume with unique combat skills using signboards. Known for dexterity and artist skills. Birthday: September 7; height 180 cm; weight 123 kg.\\n\\n(Source: Wikipedia)\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Unknown\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Unknown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"White\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"N/A\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Unknown\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Animals\",\n      \"Mascots\",\n      \"Cosplayers\",\n      \"Comic Relief\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Hedoro\",\n    \"bio\": \"Hedoro is a monster and friend of the Yorozuya, known for his love of nature and contrast between his ugly face and the bright flower atop his head.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Green\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"N/A\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Unknown\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Monsters\",\n      \"Animal Lovers\",\n      \"Nature Powers\",\n      \"Beastmasters\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Ayumu Toujou\",\n    \"bio\": \"Loyal servant to Kyuubei, speaking politely and addressing her as young master. Keeps a detailed diary of Kyuubei's activities and exhibits unique eye traits when surprised or distressed. Has a peculiar obsession with beating raw egg yolks on rice. Based on Aya Tojou from Strawberry 100%.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Black (normally closed)\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Teen\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Loyal Servants\",\n      \"Analytical\",\n      \"Single Parents\",\n      \"Strong-Willed\",\n      \"Quiet\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Tama\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 166 cm\\n\\nAn android maid found by Gintoki, originally a disembodied head. Named by Kagura, works at Otose's Snack House and collects rent at Yorozuya. Created by Professor Hayashi as a companion for his sick daughter, who died during an experiment. Possesses the \\\"Seed\\\" element allowing human-like emotions and personality retention. Learns from those around her despite limited understanding of the outside world.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Female\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Blue (robotic)\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Teen\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Androids\",\n      \"Emotional\",\n      \"Maid\",\n      \"Loyal\",\n      \"Bodyguards\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Catherine\",\n    \"bio\": \"Amanto resembling a cat who worked as a thief but was rehired by Otose after prison. Speaks Japanese with a katakana accent and was part of a thief crew resembling famous characters. Supports her family through her work.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Female\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Green\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Long\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"Yes\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Thieves\",\n      \"Cats\",\n      \"Cosplayers\",\n      \"Animal Lovers\",\n      \"Strong-Willed\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Hata Ouji\",\n    \"bio\": \"Amusing purple alien prince obsessed with collecting rare pets, often causing havoc unknowingly. Nicknamed \\\"Baka Ouji\\\" (Stupid Prince) due to his incompetence in pet management. Characterized by a Swiss-inspired theme and resemblance to Dragon Ball's Majin Buu.\\n\\n(Source: Wikipedia)\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Purple\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Adult\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Aliens\",\n      \"Animals\",\n      \"Comic Relief\",\n      \"Royalty\",\n      \"Single Parents\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Jii\",\n    \"bio\": \"Faithful follower and loyal attendant to Prince Hata.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"White\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Adult\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Loyal Servants\",\n      \"Sidekicks\",\n      \"Comedy\",\n      \"Animal Lovers\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Abuto\",\n    \"bio\": \"Veteran Yato clan member who travels with Kamui. Values his kind and dislikes fighting fellow Yato despite his bloodthirsty nature. Philosophical, seeing life as choices with consequences. Lost his left arm trying to stop a conflict between Housen and Kamui.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Red\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Dark Green\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"30s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Bloodthirsty\",\n      \"Veterans\",\n      \"Strong-Willed\",\n      \"Loyal\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Matako Kijima\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 165 cm\\n\\nOnly female member of the Kiheitai, skilled with pistols and fiercely loyal to Takasugi. Shows quick temper and screeches when upset, interacting notably with Henpeita Takechi. Based on samurai Kijima Matabei.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Female\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Medium\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"20s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Gunfighters\",\n      \"Loyal\",\n      \"Hot-Headed\",\n      \"Feudal Retainers\",\n      \"Combat Illusionists\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Nizou Okada\",\n    \"bio\": \"No bio available.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Unknown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Unknown\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Unknown\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"Unknown\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Unknown\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Henpeita Takechi\",\n    \"bio\": \"__Height:__ 178 cm\\n\\nStrategist of the Kiheitai and self-proclaimed feminist. Believed by others to have a Lolita complex. Known for sensitivity to Kagura's potential. Fate unknown after injury from Okada. Based on samurai Takechi Hanpeita.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"30s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Strategists\",\n      \"Feudal Retainers\",\n      \"Feminists\",\n      \"Analytical\",\n      \"Samurai\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Bansai Kawakami\",\n    \"bio\": \"Calm but cruel assassin and skilled swordsman of the Kiheitai. Regularly wears headphones and sunglasses. Plays shamisen, doubling as a weapon and tool. Also a talented songwriter and music producer. Sacrificed himself in the Silver Soul War. Name inspired by historical and musical figures.\",\n    \"characteristics\": {\n      \"gender\": \"Male\",\n      \"eyeColor\": \"Brown\",\n      \"hairColor\": \"Black\",\n      \"hairLength\": \"Short\",\n      \"apparentAge\": \"30s\",\n      \"animalEars\": \"No\"\n    },\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"Assassins\",\n      \"Musicians\",\n      \"Samurai\",\n      \"Dangerous\",\n      \"Fudanshi\"\n    ]\n  }\n]
